{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Approach changed before any review completed: the coordinator ruled out skipping or deselecting the test. The test now uses a key that is invalid on every platform, plus a binding-level test that pins the per-platform permission rule. The earlier plan-review run was stopped."},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1795136518978365001,"uuid":"1928e41e-e171-4ac8-98f3-798a2fcc4a8b"}